  $done({ body: "WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\nSTYLE\n::cue(.italic) { font-style:italic }\n\n9901803\n00:00:12.628 --> 00:00:14.708 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\nGitHub：rexchen1803\n\nsrc-1\n00:00:14.788 --> 00:00:21.753 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>芝加哥今日天朗气清\n气温在70度以上</c>\n\nsrc-2\n00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:28.677 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>目前在湖畔的气温是75度\n中途岛73度，奥黑尔73度</c>\n\nsrc-3\n00:00:33.659 --> 00:00:36.560 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>汤姆</c>\n\nsrc-4\n00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:42.751 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 什么事？\n- 是费利，看他的样子\n\nsrc-5\n00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:47.904 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利？\n\nsrc-6\n00:00:48.112 --> 00:00:53.136 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他没有发烧\n但胃痛又头晕眼花\n\nsrc-7\n00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:57.307 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 费利，你没事吧？\n- 爸爸？\n\nsrc-8\n00:00:57.391 --> 00:01:01.500 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n摸一下他双手，又冷又湿\n\nsrc-9\n00:01:04.921 --> 00:01:09.424 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我没事，我要起床\n- 不行\n\nsrc-10\n00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:12.886 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我今天有测验\n- 不行\n\nsrc-11\n00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:18.745 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n我一定要参加测验\n我要进优秀大学，有丰盛人生\n\nsrc-12\n00:01:18.829 --> 00:01:22.312 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n乖儿子，你这样子绝不能上学\n\nsrc-13\n00:01:22.562 --> 00:01:26.524 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他怎么了？\n- 他不舒服\n\nsrc-14\n00:01:26.775 --> 00:01:30.299 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n把那句鬼话晾干了\n都能拿来给草坪施肥\n\nsrc-15\n00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:34.698 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n珍妮，是你吗？\n\nsrc-16\n00:01:34.907 --> 00:01:38.452 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n你站到那么远，我看不清楚\n\nsrc-17\n00:01:38.661 --> 00:01:42.081 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n珍妮，我……\n\nsrc-18\n00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:48.233 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 老弟，别装蒜\n- 珍妮，快上学去\n\nsrc-19\n00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:55.365 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就算我双眼流血，你们仍会\n要我上学，这实在不公平\n\nsrc-20\n00:01:55.449 --> 00:02:00.454 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n珍妮，别为我难过\n你该庆幸自己那么健康\n\nsrc-21\n00:02:06.168 --> 00:02:09.899 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n够了，我不要再留在这个家\n\nsrc-22\n00:02:10.923 --> 00:02:17.304 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我没事的，我会继续睡\n或许在正午左右吃止痛药\n\nsrc-23\n00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:22.726 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n我今天会带佛蒙特来的那家人\n去看房子\n\nsrc-24\n00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:27.731 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n若要找我，问我的同事便可以\n\nsrc-25\n00:02:28.106 --> 00:02:34.279 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我会来电看你怎样\n- 你们实在关心我\n\nsrc-26\n00:02:34.381 --> 00:02:38.302 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n你们实在太好人了\n\nsrc-27\n00:02:43.015 --> 00:02:47.144 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n- 多点休息吧，乖孩子\n- 好的\n\nsrc-28\n00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:51.505 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n我会准六时回来\n若有任何需要，记紧来电\n\nsrc-29\n00:02:51.588 --> 00:02:54.066 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n打电话\n\nsrc-30\n00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:00.781 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n- 宝贝，再见\n- 我也爱你们\n\nsrc-31\n00:03:02.349 --> 00:03:05.328 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n有需要尽管来电\n\nsrc-32\n00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:16.005 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他们上当了\n\nsrc-33\n00:03:24.663 --> 00:03:30.602 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n难以置信，我的表现那么不济\n他们竟没怀疑\n\nsrc-34\n00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:39.678 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n像这样一天我怎能上学呢？\n\nsrc-35\n00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:54.708 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这已是我在本学期第九次病倒\n实在再难想出什么新病症来\n\nsrc-36\n00:03:56.195 --> 00:04:00.782 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n第十次时可能要吐出肺部\n所以，我要好好利用今天病假\n\nsrc-37\n00:04:03.285 --> 00:04:06.413 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n湿而冷的双手\n是骗倒父母的关键\n\nsrc-38\n00:04:06.496 --> 00:04:11.126 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是\"百搭\"病征，万试万灵\n\nsrc-39\n00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:15.047 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n很多人说装作发烧是最好方法\n\nsrc-40\n00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:21.901 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但若你母亲太紧张的话\n你可能要看医生，这样更糟\n\nsrc-41\n00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.904 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你装作胃抽筋\n\nsrc-42\n00:04:25.113 --> 00:04:29.728 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n在弯腰呻吟时，顺势舔湿手掌\n\nsrc-43\n00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:33.482 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这样既幼稚又无聊\n但上中学又何尝不是呢？\n\nsrc-44\n00:04:35.234 --> 00:04:38.333 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n人生匆匆\n\nsrc-45\n00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:44.381 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若你不偶尔停下来四处看看\n会错过很多事\n\nsrc-46\n00:04:45.536 --> 00:04:49.011 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n今天确有测验，我没有说谎\n\nsrc-47\n00:04:49.219 --> 00:04:53.460 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n题目是欧洲社会主义\n但测验有什么用呢？\n\nsrc-48\n00:04:53.627 --> 00:04:59.091 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我又不是欧洲人\n管他是不是社会主义\n\nsrc-49\n00:04:59.174 --> 00:05:03.512 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就算是法西斯无政府主义者\n也无法令我有车代步\n\nsrc-50\n00:05:07.099 --> 00:05:10.406 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我记起秋天时的中央公园</c>\n\nsrc-51\n00:05:10.615 --> 00:05:14.952 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>你怎样撕破自己的裙子\n我承认，真是一团糟……</c>\n\nsrc-52\n00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:26.827 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我并非容忍法西斯主义\n或任何主义\n\nsrc-53\n00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:33.011 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n人不该相信什么主义\n该相信自己\n\nsrc-54\n00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:37.588 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n约翰连侬说过\n我不相信披头四，我相信自己\n\nsrc-55\n00:05:37.921 --> 00:05:41.853 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有道理，毕竟他是海象\n\nsrc-56\n00:05:42.009 --> 00:05:46.316 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我也可以这样\n但我仍要坐人家的顺风车\n\nsrc-57\n00:05:46.471 --> 00:05:49.152 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n艾当斯，艾当利\n\nsrc-58\n00:05:49.361 --> 00:05:54.438 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 在\n- 艾当基，艾当逊\n\nsrc-59\n00:05:54.616 --> 00:05:57.910 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 艾迪拿\n- 在\n\nsrc-60\n00:05:57.941 --> 00:06:02.373 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 安德逊，安德逊？\n- 在\n\nsrc-61\n00:06:02.571 --> 00:06:04.959 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n布费利\n\nsrc-62\n00:06:06.241 --> 00:06:08.629 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n布费利\n\nsrc-63\n00:06:08.869 --> 00:06:12.508 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n布费利……\n\nsrc-64\n00:06:12.716 --> 00:06:18.305 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他病了，我好友妹妹的男友\n的哥哥的女朋友\n\nsrc-65\n00:06:18.556 --> 00:06:24.510 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看到费利昨晚在快餐店晕倒\n情况好像颇为严重\n\nsrc-66\n00:06:24.602 --> 00:06:28.430 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 谢谢你告诉我\n- 别客气\n\nsrc-67\n00:06:28.597 --> 00:06:31.150 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n范马伦\n\nsrc-68\n00:06:31.359 --> 00:06:35.270 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n范马伦\n\nsrc-69\n00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:47.157 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 喂？\n- 马伦，发生什么事？\n\nsrc-70\n00:06:48.742 --> 00:06:52.546 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 没什么\n- 你觉得怎样？\n\nsrc-71\n00:06:52.754 --> 00:06:56.049 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 完全崩溃\n- 你妈妈在你房间吗？\n\nsrc-72\n00:06:56.583 --> 00:07:00.212 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n她在迪凯特\n可惜她并非留在那儿\n\nsrc-73\n00:07:01.964 --> 00:07:06.301 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你在哪里？\n- 我休息一天，过来吧\n\nsrc-74\n00:07:06.593 --> 00:07:10.514 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 不行，我病倒了\n- 心理作用而已\n\nsrc-75\n00:07:10.597 --> 00:07:15.477 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 过来吧\n- 我很不舒服，哪里也不能去\n\nsrc-76\n00:07:15.561 --> 00:07:20.448 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n实在很遗憾，快驾车过来接我\n\nsrc-77\n00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:32.251 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我快死了\n\nsrc-78\n00:07:37.416 --> 00:07:42.010 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>不是的，你只是无所事事罢了</c>\n\nsrc-79\n00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:47.217 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦实在需要放假一天\n\nsrc-80\n00:07:47.426 --> 00:07:54.141 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他在上大学前有很多东西\n要搞清楚\n\nsrc-81\n00:07:54.272 --> 00:07:59.611 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>当马伦在埃及</c>\n\nsrc-82\n00:08:01.273 --> 00:08:05.986 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>让我的马伦走吧</c>\n\nsrc-83\n00:08:06.069 --> 00:08:09.072 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦紧张得很……\n\nsrc-84\n00:08:09.156 --> 00:08:12.539 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若把碳塞进他的屁股\n会变成钻石\n\nsrc-85\n00:08:20.167 --> 00:08:23.754 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我是布凯蒂\n- 我是训导主任罗艾华\n\nsrc-86\n00:08:23.837 --> 00:08:30.469 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n对不起，我忘了致电给你们\n\nsrc-87\n00:08:30.683 --> 00:08:36.475 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>- 你知道令郎今天没上学吗？\n- 知道，费利病了，在家休息</c>\n\nsrc-88\n00:08:36.558 --> 00:08:42.563 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我今早要开会\n忘记致电你们，很抱歉</c>\n\nsrc-89\n00:08:42.694 --> 00:08:45.567 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n请问你知否……\n\nsrc-90\n00:08:45.651 --> 00:08:50.614 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利的上课率并非太好？\n\nsrc-91\n00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.366 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>什么？</c>\n\nsrc-92\n00:08:52.574 --> 00:08:56.666 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他有多天没上课\n\nsrc-93\n00:08:56.875 --> 00:09:00.624 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利没有认真对待学业\n\nsrc-94\n00:09:00.707 --> 00:09:05.716 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我今早一直在翻查他的纪录\n\nsrc-95\n00:09:05.879 --> 00:09:12.553 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若费利以为他这样可顺利毕业\n就大错特错了\n\nsrc-96\n00:09:12.928 --> 00:09:15.848 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我十分赞成……-</c>\n\nsrc-97\n00:09:15.931 --> 00:09:20.063 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n把他留级\n\nsrc-98\n00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:24.610 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我完全不知道这些事\n- 通常都是这样的\n\nsrc-99\n00:09:24.648 --> 00:09:31.532 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他在本学期已缺课了九次\n- 九次？\n\nsrc-100\n00:09:31.741 --> 00:09:36.118 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 九次\n- 他并没病倒过九次\n\nsrc-101\n00:09:36.201 --> 00:09:41.167 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这大概因为他根本没有病\n他逃学\n\nsrc-102\n00:09:41.498 --> 00:09:44.126 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n清醒吧\n\nsrc-103\n00:09:44.209 --> 00:09:48.589 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他愚弄了你，他逃学\n\nsrc-104\n00:09:48.672 --> 00:09:52.595 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我不相信\n- 证据就在我面前\n\nsrc-105\n00:09:52.803 --> 00:09:55.345 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他已缺课了九天……\n\nsrc-106\n00:09:58.223 --> 00:10:02.644 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n缺课次数，5，4，3，2……\n\nsrc-107\n00:10:03.562 --> 00:10:08.358 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我想要汽车，却得到一台电脑\n真不幸\n\nsrc-108\n00:10:08.526 --> 00:10:10.611 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n姬丝\n\nsrc-109\n00:10:15.699 --> 00:10:20.245 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n罗先生，费利在家\n他很不舒服\n\nsrc-110\n00:10:20.579 --> 00:10:24.374 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我甚至不想抛下他一人\n- 姬丝\n\nsrc-111\n00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:28.671 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n每年这时候\n孩子最容易不想上学\n\nsrc-112\n00:10:28.879 --> 00:10:33.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但我可保证费利真的是不舒服\n\nsrc-113\n00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:41.267 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n无师自通\n\nsrc-114\n00:10:43.018 --> 00:10:50.776 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n1930年，众议院为减轻什么？\n\nsrc-115\n00:10:50.859 --> 00:10:52.777 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有没有人知道？\n\nsrc-116\n00:10:52.986 --> 00:10:58.616 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n减轻大萧条的影响\n通过了什么？\n\nsrc-117\n00:10:58.659 --> 00:11:03.162 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n霍利-斯穆特关税法案\n\nsrc-118\n00:11:03.371 --> 00:11:06.708 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n把关税调高或调低？\n\nsrc-119\n00:11:06.875 --> 00:11:12.589 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n把关税调高以增加政府收入\n\nsrc-120\n00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:16.884 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有没有效呢？\n有没有人知道？\n\nsrc-121\n00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:21.473 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n没有效，美国更加萧条\n\nsrc-122\n00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:26.979 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n今日，我们亦有类似的辩论\n有没有人知道是什么？\n\nsrc-123\n00:11:28.272 --> 00:11:31.064 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有没有人看过这个？\n\nsrc-124\n00:11:31.066 --> 00:11:34.318 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n拉弗曲线\n有没有人知道当中理论？\n\nsrc-125\n00:11:34.526 --> 00:11:38.615 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n理论指在收入曲线的这一点……\n\nsrc-126\n00:11:38.699 --> 00:11:43.745 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你得到的收入会跟这一点一样\n\nsrc-127\n00:11:43.829 --> 00:11:49.334 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有没有人知道\n副总统布什在80年说过什么？\n\nsrc-128\n00:11:49.501 --> 00:11:56.258 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有没有人知道？什么经济？\n伏都经济\n\nsrc-129\n00:12:08.187 --> 00:12:11.732 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n珍妮，我为你弟弟的事难过\n\nsrc-130\n00:12:11.815 --> 00:12:14.568 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你难过什么？\n要与他同住的是我\n\nsrc-131\n00:12:15.065 --> 00:12:19.198 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我听闻他病得很重\n- 谁说的？\n\nsrc-132\n00:12:19.281 --> 00:12:22.864 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好些人说他快死了\n\nsrc-133\n00:12:23.073 --> 00:12:28.749 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n据说如果费利死了\n他会把眼睛捐给史蒂夫·汪达\n\nsrc-134\n00:12:28.999 --> 00:12:32.582 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他实在好心，再见\n\nsrc-135\n00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:36.126 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 珍妮\n- 闭嘴\n\nsrc-136\n00:12:36.256 --> 00:12:39.718 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n情况有多严重？\n\nsrc-137\n00:12:39.801 --> 00:12:42.550 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>你看过《异形》吗？</c>\n\nsrc-138\n00:12:42.596 --> 00:12:46.512 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n记不记得当异形\n破开那男人肚子出来的情形\n\nsrc-139\n00:12:46.517 --> 00:12:50.020 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就是那样子了\n新生\n\nsrc-140\n00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:55.062 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你说笑吧？\n- 我似在说笑吗？\n\nsrc-141\n00:12:55.234 --> 00:12:59.196 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 是布费利\n- 他助我离开暑期学校\n\nsrc-142\n00:12:59.274 --> 00:13:04.409 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢你告诉我们你的病情\n\nsrc-143\n00:13:05.536 --> 00:13:09.414 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他千万不要死\n否则我今夏一定很难挨\n\nsrc-144\n00:13:09.498 --> 00:13:13.621 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 叫别的人来听吧\n- 好的，等一下\n\nsrc-145\n00:13:14.294 --> 00:13:18.001 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>- 你看过《异形》吗？\n- 看过，怎么了？</c>\n\nsrc-146\n00:13:19.842 --> 00:13:23.220 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n喂？费利，你的身体怎样？\n\nsrc-147\n00:13:24.847 --> 00:13:26.807 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你好像病得很重\n\nsrc-148\n00:13:30.769 --> 00:13:35.058 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 严重吗？\n- 希望不严重\n\nsrc-149\n00:13:35.357 --> 00:13:40.571 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我或需要换肾\n- 天呀，你是否很不开心？\n\nsrc-150\n00:13:41.864 --> 00:13:44.735 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 对不起\n- 你本周末还会活着么？\n\nsrc-151\n00:13:44.943 --> 00:13:49.114 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 会的\n- 好极，或许到时来探望你吧\n\nsrc-152\n00:14:03.169 --> 00:14:08.765 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我绝对不相信这小子\n我恨不得撵他走\n\nsrc-153\n00:14:08.849 --> 00:14:15.856 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你膝部有旧患\n不该撵走任何人\n\nsrc-154\n00:14:15.932 --> 00:14:21.737 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他最危险之处是教坏好学生\n\nsrc-155\n00:14:21.811 --> 00:14:28.735 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我不想见到有1500个\n布费利的信徒在学校四处走\n\nsrc-156\n00:14:28.911 --> 00:14:32.831 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他危害到我管理学生的能力\n\nsrc-157\n00:14:32.906 --> 00:14:39.588 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他令你看来像个傻瓜\n- 谢谢，但你错了\n\nsrc-158\n00:14:39.671 --> 00:14:42.216 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他很受欢迎\n\nsrc-159\n00:14:42.624 --> 00:14:47.044 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n爱运动的、爱驾车的、古怪的\n放荡的、爱浪费的……\n\nsrc-160\n00:14:47.253 --> 00:14:52.434 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n爱哭的、愚蠢的，都喜欢他\n\nsrc-161\n00:14:54.436 --> 00:14:57.272 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n所以我才要抓到他\n\nsrc-162\n00:14:57.356 --> 00:15:02.736 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n向其他学生证明\n他这样是没前途的\n\nsrc-163\n00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:07.533 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你活像“卑鄙哈利”啊\n\nsrc-164\n00:15:07.616 --> 00:15:10.985 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n真的？\n\nsrc-165\n00:15:14.988 --> 00:15:17.167 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n过奖，姬丝\n\nsrc-166\n00:15:17.251 --> 00:15:22.840 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你不能这样子要我等\n- 让我安息吧\n\nsrc-167\n00:15:22.965 --> 00:15:29.972 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这是我第九次病倒，若被抓到\n便无法毕业，我是为了你冒险\n\nsrc-168\n00:15:30.055 --> 00:15:34.048 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 知道什么是心律舒张期吗？\n- 吃些消化药\n\nsrc-169\n00:15:34.257 --> 00:15:38.051 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 快穿好衣服，然后过来\n- 闭嘴\n\nsrc-170\n00:15:38.218 --> 00:15:44.892 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n等一下，有人来电……喂？\n\nsrc-171\n00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:52.286 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>- 费利，你似乎仍很不舒服\n- 我还以为自己的情况好转</c>\n\nsrc-172\n00:15:52.494 --> 00:15:56.290 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你是否在睡觉？\n- 爸爸，你可否等一下？\n\nsrc-173\n00:15:56.373 --> 00:15:59.072 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 好的\n- 等一下\n\nsrc-174\n00:15:59.334 --> 00:16:03.422 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 卡梅隆，是我爸打来的\n- 太好了，别拖我下水\n\nsrc-175\n00:16:03.505 --> 00:16:09.678 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若你在15分钟内还不过来\n找另一个好朋友吧\n\nsrc-176\n00:16:12.306 --> 00:16:16.852 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n爸爸，跟你说话后\n我又有点头晕\n\nsrc-177\n00:16:16.935 --> 00:16:22.649 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我还是躺下\n- 用热毛巾敷在额上\n\nsrc-178\n00:16:22.733 --> 00:16:29.239 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 敷热毛巾\n- 喝点热汤，然后再睡一会\n\nsrc-179\n00:16:29.323 --> 00:16:34.731 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 费利，好好休息\n- 你真关心我\n\nsrc-180\n00:16:38.248 --> 00:16:44.213 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我敢打赌马伦正坐在车里\n盘算应否出门\n\nsrc-181\n00:16:48.342 --> 00:16:52.304 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他会不断来电至我往他那儿\n\nsrc-182\n00:16:52.387 --> 00:16:55.544 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他会令我感内疚\n\nsrc-183\n00:16:55.599 --> 00:17:00.130 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n实在荒谬，去吧\n\nsrc-184\n00:17:00.381 --> 00:17:03.342 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n去吧，真气人\n\nsrc-185\n00:17:08.569 --> 00:17:11.267 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n怎么搞的\n\nsrc-186\n00:17:20.165 --> 00:17:23.153 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n算了\n\nsrc-187\n00:17:42.521 --> 00:17:48.902 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n作者以什么方法……\n\nsrc-188\n00:17:50.779 --> 00:17:56.310 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n用监狱去……\n\nsrc-189\n00:18:00.497 --> 00:18:02.624 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n象征……\n\nsrc-190\n00:18:10.908 --> 00:18:14.536 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n故事主人翁的挣扎？\n\nsrc-191\n00:18:14.745 --> 00:18:18.098 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这样又跟我们所讨论的\n\nsrc-192\n00:18:18.223 --> 00:18:22.668 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n讽刺手法有何关系呢？\n\nsrc-193\n00:18:24.188 --> 00:18:27.924 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n卢先生，抱歉打扰你\n\nsrc-194\n00:18:33.679 --> 00:18:38.160 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n白思朗，可否跟你谈谈？\n\nsrc-195\n00:18:40.579 --> 00:18:45.899 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n恐怕我有坏消息要告诉你\n\nsrc-196\n00:18:46.084 --> 00:18:51.423 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n令尊来电说你的外婆刚去世\n\nsrc-197\n00:18:53.258 --> 00:18:59.371 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 不……\n- 真可怜\n\nsrc-198\n00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:04.061 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 外婆死了？\n- 白先生是这样说的\n\nsrc-199\n00:19:04.394 --> 00:19:08.463 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我叫了史兰丝通知她\n\nsrc-200\n00:19:08.672 --> 00:19:13.801 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 她在和谁约会？\n- 现在可不好说\n\nsrc-201\n00:19:14.029 --> 00:19:17.888 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但我见到她跟布费利来往颇密\n\nsrc-202\n00:19:18.951 --> 00:19:23.038 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n替我找白先生的联络电话号码\n\nsrc-203\n00:19:25.832 --> 00:19:28.627 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>- 罗艾华办公室\n- 我是白佐治</c>\n\nsrc-204\n00:19:28.941 --> 00:19:33.048 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n请稍等，是白先生来电\n\nsrc-205\n00:19:35.676 --> 00:19:38.575 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n还要不要他的联络电话号码？\n\nsrc-206\n00:19:42.766 --> 00:19:46.311 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>- 我是罗艾华\n- 我是白佐治</c>\n\nsrc-207\n00:19:46.895 --> 00:19:51.817 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你好吗？\n- 其实并不好\n\nsrc-208\n00:19:51.984 --> 00:19:57.260 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我有所听闻，请节哀顺变\n\nsrc-209\n00:19:57.468 --> 00:20:01.243 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>今早真难熬</c>\n\nsrc-210\n00:20:01.326 --> 00:20:04.288 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我们有很多家事要办</c>\n\nsrc-211\n00:20:04.371 --> 00:20:07.791 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>若你准许思朗休息，我很感激</c>\n\nsrc-212\n00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:11.106 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我乐意这样做\n\nsrc-213\n00:20:11.315 --> 00:20:15.903 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n只要你给我看尸体\n我就会让思朗走\n\nsrc-214\n00:20:15.924 --> 00:20:20.012 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我要亲眼见到这死去的外婆\n\nsrc-215\n00:20:20.095 --> 00:20:25.475 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不要紧，是布费利\n我在设陷阱\n\nsrc-216\n00:20:27.394 --> 00:20:31.982 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>你是否说要看到尸体？</c>\n\nsrc-217\n00:20:32.065 --> 00:20:37.863 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是的，送尸体来，我就放人\n\nsrc-218\n00:20:37.946 --> 00:20:41.636 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>这是学校政策，是你母亲吗？</c>\n\nsrc-219\n00:20:41.844 --> 00:20:44.847 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>不是，是内子的母亲</c>\n\nsrc-220\n00:20:46.121 --> 00:20:51.919 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 罗艾华办公室\n- 我是布费利，想找罗先生\n\nsrc-221\n00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:57.692 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n稍等……\n\nsrc-222\n00:20:57.841 --> 00:21:02.113 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n告诉你，笨蛋\n若你不喜欢我的政策\n\nsrc-223\n00:21:02.322 --> 00:21:06.910 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你可以来这儿舐我的肥臀\n\nsrc-224\n00:21:07.118 --> 00:21:12.147 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 知道没有，什么事？\n- 布费利在二线\n\nsrc-225\n00:21:23.116 --> 00:21:28.455 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>罗先生，我今天不舒服</c>\n\nsrc-226\n00:21:28.539 --> 00:21:33.836 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n可以把我的作业交给我姐姐吗？\n\nsrc-227\n00:21:33.978 --> 00:21:36.647 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>谢谢你，再见</c>\n\nsrc-228\n00:21:50.811 --> 00:21:56.191 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n白先生……我要向你道歉\n\nsrc-229\n00:21:56.275 --> 00:22:00.904 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 当然\n- 我……\n\nsrc-230\n00:22:00.988 --> 00:22:04.090 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你早该向我道歉\n\nsrc-231\n00:22:04.299 --> 00:22:08.620 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我的亲人死了，你却侮辱我\n你怎么了？\n\nsrc-232\n00:22:08.761 --> 00:22:12.875 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n其实……我也不知道\n\nsrc-233\n00:22:12.958 --> 00:22:16.420 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我以为我在跟别人说话</c>\n\nsrc-234\n00:22:16.503 --> 00:22:24.193 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我绝不会蓄意侮辱你的\n\nsrc-235\n00:22:24.401 --> 00:22:29.558 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n恕我直言，你实在是个大笨蛋\n\nsrc-236\n00:22:29.641 --> 00:22:34.479 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你说得对，快去找她\n\nsrc-237\n00:22:34.563 --> 00:22:39.443 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我不会就此罢休，你听到没？\n- 听得很清楚\n\nsrc-238\n00:22:39.526 --> 00:22:43.711 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 叫我做先生\n- 是的，先生\n\nsrc-239\n00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:46.297 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>这样才像样</c>\n\nsrc-240\n00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.579 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你要打起十二分精神\n并记着你要应付的是谁\n\nsrc-241\n00:22:51.788 --> 00:22:54.625 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是布费利\n\nsrc-242\n00:22:55.918 --> 00:22:58.921 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我很害怕\n若他认出我的声音那怎办？\n\nsrc-243\n00:22:59.004 --> 00:23:02.563 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n没可能，你装得十分相像\n\nsrc-244\n00:23:09.473 --> 00:23:14.686 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n罗，冷静\n\nsrc-245\n00:23:14.770 --> 00:23:22.778 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 等一下\n- 办公室小意外\n\nsrc-246\n00:23:22.861 --> 00:23:28.575 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我没时间整天骂你，长话短说\n\nsrc-247\n00:23:28.659 --> 00:23:33.760 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我要小女在十分钟后\n一个人在学校门口\n\nsrc-248\n00:23:34.552 --> 00:23:38.168 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 什么事？\n- 那样太惹人怀疑了\n\nsrc-249\n00:23:38.252 --> 00:23:40.754 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 继续说\n- 你\n\nsrc-250\n00:23:41.922 --> 00:23:48.524 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 继续说\n- 鲁尼，你听着\n\nsrc-251\n00:23:48.732 --> 00:23:54.530 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我要你陪她在校门\n我有话要跟你说\n\nsrc-252\n00:23:56.770 --> 00:24:01.441 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们现在没时间\n午饭时间再跟你说\n\nsrc-253\n00:24:02.818 --> 00:24:06.947 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你怎么了？\n- 慢着\n\nsrc-254\n00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:11.910 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你怎么搞的？\n- 你为何踢我？\n\nsrc-255\n00:24:13.412 --> 00:24:18.678 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若罗跟思朗一起，怎接她呢？\n\nsrc-256\n00:24:18.876 --> 00:24:23.725 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我说要她独个在校门\n你又害怕\n\nsrc-257\n00:24:25.757 --> 00:24:29.011 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我没有打你，不过轻力拍你\n\nsrc-258\n00:24:29.094 --> 00:24:31.982 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你有打我\n\nsrc-259\n00:24:34.099 --> 00:24:40.606 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若你不喜欢我的方式\n就别要我参与你的无聊大计\n\nsrc-260\n00:24:40.731 --> 00:24:44.244 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是你要我起床来这里\n\nsrc-261\n00:24:44.494 --> 00:24:48.457 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是你要我致电给罗艾华\n\nsrc-262\n00:24:48.697 --> 00:24:51.585 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那人可以把我置诸死地\n\nsrc-263\n00:24:51.793 --> 00:24:55.129 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 而你竟然全不理会我的感受\n- 我没有\n\nsrc-264\n00:24:55.338 --> 00:25:01.052 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我没有不理会你的感受\n\nsrc-265\n00:25:03.670 --> 00:25:08.226 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你做什么？\n- 再见，我回家了\n\nsrc-266\n00:25:08.476 --> 00:25:12.721 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 祝你好运\n- 慢着\n\nsrc-267\n00:25:12.804 --> 00:25:17.818 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我不是有意发脾气，对不起\n\nsrc-268\n00:25:18.310 --> 00:25:20.103 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 真的？\n- 真的\n\nsrc-269\n00:25:28.779 --> 00:25:32.624 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 来吧\n- 劳驾\n\nsrc-270\n00:25:35.160 --> 00:25:39.548 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但你的确弄砸了事情\n\nsrc-271\n00:25:39.756 --> 00:25:45.671 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 但也不尽是你的错\n- 为什么？\n\nsrc-272\n00:25:45.679 --> 00:25:52.142 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n为挽救这情况，我要你帮忙\n\nsrc-273\n00:26:10.279 --> 00:26:15.242 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那辆1961年250GT法拉利跑车\n\nsrc-274\n00:26:18.745 --> 00:26:21.504 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n全球不足100辆\n\nsrc-275\n00:26:21.713 --> 00:26:25.800 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我爸爸用了三年修好它\n\nsrc-276\n00:26:25.919 --> 00:26:29.173 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那是他的至爱，他的命根\n\nsrc-277\n00:26:29.590 --> 00:26:33.850 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是他的错，他没锁好车库\n\nsrc-278\n00:26:34.052 --> 00:26:37.645 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你在说什么？\n\nsrc-279\n00:26:40.434 --> 00:26:43.061 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我爸爸视这车如命\n\nsrc-280\n00:26:43.145 --> 00:26:48.739 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这样的男人配不上这种车\n\nsrc-281\n00:26:49.740 --> 00:26:51.987 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不行\n\nsrc-282\n00:26:52.946 --> 00:26:55.866 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你似乎不明白\n\nsrc-283\n00:26:55.949 --> 00:27:00.834 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他从没开过它\n只拿软布擦拭它\n\nsrc-284\n00:27:02.247 --> 00:27:07.215 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n记不记得我弄坏牙齿保持器时\n他有多抓狂？\n\nsrc-285\n00:27:07.294 --> 00:27:12.049 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那不过是块胶，而这是法拉利\n\nsrc-286\n00:27:14.343 --> 00:27:18.013 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们不能用你的车去接思朗\n\nsrc-287\n00:27:18.096 --> 00:27:23.147 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n罗不会相信白先生驾那辆废铁\n\nsrc-288\n00:27:23.356 --> 00:27:26.567 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 那并非废铁\n- 是废铁\n\nsrc-289\n00:27:26.734 --> 00:27:31.527 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我连废铁也没有，我很羡慕你\n\nsrc-290\n00:27:33.153 --> 00:27:37.115 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n抱歉……已别无他法\n\nsrc-291\n00:27:48.794 --> 00:27:51.839 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他知道车子的里数\n- 他不相信你吗？\n\nsrc-292\n00:27:51.883 --> 00:27:56.218 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 从不相信，亦永不会相信\n- 其实很简单\n\nsrc-293\n00:27:56.468 --> 00:28:00.266 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n只要把多走的里数删掉便是\n\nsrc-294\n00:28:00.432 --> 00:28:04.019 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我们倒车开回家就行\n- 不行\n\nsrc-295\n00:28:04.270 --> 00:28:10.901 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n真的不行，你还是放弃\n\nsrc-296\n00:28:11.191 --> 00:28:15.948 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不如我们租一辆凯迪拉克吧\n我出钱\n\nsrc-297\n00:28:16.113 --> 00:28:23.120 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们可以租轿车\n特长那种，车内有电视和酒吧\n\nsrc-298\n00:28:26.874 --> 00:28:29.919 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n来，开心一点吧\n\nsrc-299\n00:28:32.671 --> 00:28:36.633 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我为你的事很难过\n\nsrc-300\n00:28:36.884 --> 00:28:42.097 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我亦曾有外婆……更有两个\n\nsrc-301\n00:28:45.809 --> 00:28:50.731 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n生命苦短\n\nsrc-302\n00:28:50.898 --> 00:28:54.818 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n刹那光华，朝花夕拾\n\nsrc-303\n00:28:54.818 --> 00:28:58.113 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n如梦似烟……\n\nsrc-304\n00:28:58.280 --> 00:29:01.742 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n昙花一现\n\nsrc-305\n00:29:02.826 --> 00:29:05.454 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n天呀\n\nsrc-306\n00:29:08.999 --> 00:29:13.712 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若要从悲伤和空虚中选择\n我会选悲伤\n\nsrc-307\n00:29:15.130 --> 00:29:17.090 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好极\n\nsrc-308\n00:29:25.766 --> 00:29:29.519 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n思朗，赶快\n\nsrc-309\n00:29:31.688 --> 00:29:35.234 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是我爸，我要走了\n\nsrc-310\n00:29:39.321 --> 00:29:43.324 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n罗……艾华先生\n\nsrc-311\n00:29:43.533 --> 00:29:47.035 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你确是个君子\n- 过奖\n\nsrc-312\n00:29:47.285 --> 00:29:52.332 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢你那么体贴和关心\n\nsrc-313\n00:29:59.589 --> 00:30:01.760 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n垃圾\n\nsrc-314\n00:30:04.388 --> 00:30:09.224 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 不给爸爸一个吻？\n- 你说笑吧\n\nsrc-315\n00:30:18.649 --> 00:30:21.655 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n原来这是他们的家族习惯\n\nsrc-316\n00:30:26.869 --> 00:30:31.248 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 卡梅伦，你舒服吗？\n- 不舒服\n\nsrc-317\n00:30:34.543 --> 00:30:40.507 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我们打算做什么？\n- 该是我们打算不做什么？\n\nsrc-318\n00:30:40.591 --> 00:30:44.428 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n别说我们打算不驾这辆车回家\n\nsrc-319\n00:30:44.511 --> 00:30:50.096 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n要是你能开上这样的豪车\n你会不会马上开回家？\n\nsrc-320\n00:30:50.184 --> 00:30:53.308 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我也不会\n\nsrc-321\n00:31:22.419 --> 00:31:25.631 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利，别那么快\n\nsrc-322\n00:32:28.031 --> 00:32:32.327 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n救救费利，谢谢你，你很慷慨\n\nsrc-323\n00:32:32.411 --> 00:32:35.573 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n救救布费利\n\nsrc-324\n00:32:35.622 --> 00:32:38.742 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 救救费利？\n- 什么？\n\nsrc-325\n00:32:38.993 --> 00:32:43.672 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们为布费利筹款\n好让他可以换肾\n\nsrc-326\n00:32:43.755 --> 00:32:46.800 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 往别处滚吧\n- 你说什么？\n\nsrc-327\n00:32:46.925 --> 00:32:49.878 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你真可悲\n- 喂\n\nsrc-328\n00:32:50.086 --> 00:32:54.933 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若你有日要布费利帮忙那怎样\n\nsrc-329\n00:32:55.008 --> 00:33:00.305 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n第一线接通了白先生的家\n这次小心说话\n\nsrc-330\n00:33:00.430 --> 00:33:03.308 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n去死吧\n\nsrc-331\n00:33:04.276 --> 00:33:10.616 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我们目前不能接电话\n我们有家人逝世</c>\n\nsrc-332\n00:33:10.648 --> 00:33:15.579 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n一定是布费利弄出的好事\n\nsrc-333\n00:33:15.662 --> 00:33:19.833 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 现在白思朗也同流合污\n- 还有她的外婆\n\nsrc-334\n00:33:20.324 --> 00:33:22.961 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你这呆子\n\nsrc-335\n00:33:23.045 --> 00:33:26.830 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>若想找我们，请拨以下号码</c>\n\nsrc-336\n00:33:33.921 --> 00:33:40.062 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我能当上训导主任\n自有过人之处\n\nsrc-337\n00:33:40.145 --> 00:33:45.473 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>这是卡顿兄弟殡仪馆</c>\n\nsrc-338\n00:33:45.681 --> 00:33:50.280 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>请留下姓名和电话号码\n我们很快会回复你</c>\n\nsrc-339\n00:33:54.785 --> 00:33:59.612 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有不妥，我要找出是什么不妥\n\nsrc-340\n00:33:59.779 --> 00:34:03.908 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我要抓到这小子\n毁掉他的前途\n\nsrc-341\n00:34:04.116 --> 00:34:09.246 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n15年后当他回看\n自己失败一生……\n\nsrc-342\n00:34:09.716 --> 00:34:12.749 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他会记得罗艾华\n\nsrc-343\n00:34:33.907 --> 00:34:36.522 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 不行\n- 什么？\n\nsrc-344\n00:34:36.730 --> 00:34:40.664 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不是这里\n我们不会把车子停在这里\n\nsrc-345\n00:34:40.746 --> 00:34:44.710 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 为什么？\n- 我要把它停在所属的地方\n\nsrc-346\n00:34:44.793 --> 00:34:48.589 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 走吧\n- 停在车库里不会有事的\n\nsrc-347\n00:34:48.617 --> 00:34:54.123 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n车子可能遭毁坏、被偷去\n遭刮花、有黑烟\n\nsrc-348\n00:34:54.331 --> 00:34:57.931 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 甚至有雀粪\n- 冷静\n\nsrc-349\n00:34:58.098 --> 00:35:00.838 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我会给那厮五元看管车子\n\nsrc-350\n00:35:01.046 --> 00:35:03.673 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n什么那厮？\n\nsrc-351\n00:35:08.942 --> 00:35:13.308 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你好吗？你会说英语吗？\n\nsrc-352\n00:35:14.698 --> 00:35:18.897 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你以为这是什么国家？\n\nsrc-353\n00:35:19.119 --> 00:35:24.166 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好，我想你特别照顾这辆汽车\n\nsrc-354\n00:35:24.249 --> 00:35:27.294 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n没问题，相信我\n\nsrc-355\n00:35:28.378 --> 00:35:32.257 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 先生\n- 来吧\n\nsrc-356\n00:35:43.435 --> 00:35:46.340 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n放心\n\nsrc-357\n00:35:50.901 --> 00:35:55.489 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你绝对不用担心，我是专业\n\nsrc-358\n00:35:55.556 --> 00:35:58.893 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n什么专业？\n\nsrc-359\n00:36:08.335 --> 00:36:13.950 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有钱使得鬼推磨\n\nsrc-360\n00:36:14.258 --> 00:36:17.078 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n来吧\n\nsrc-361\n00:37:30.417 --> 00:37:33.943 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n希望他没事\n\nsrc-362\n00:37:44.723 --> 00:37:47.456 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>九次</c>\n\nsrc-363\n00:38:31.687 --> 00:38:34.356 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你认为车子有没有事？\n- 当然没有\n\nsrc-364\n00:38:34.523 --> 00:38:38.819 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 这是全球最高的大厦\n- 我觉得不大舒服\n\nsrc-365\n00:38:41.697 --> 00:38:44.761 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n来，像这样爬上去\n\nsrc-366\n00:38:46.243 --> 00:38:49.474 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n大家都来吧，马伦\n\nsrc-367\n00:38:50.622 --> 00:38:54.459 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好，身子向前倾\n像这样抵着玻璃窗\n\nsrc-368\n00:38:58.005 --> 00:39:01.068 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 天啊\n- 是否很棒？\n\nsrc-369\n00:39:01.277 --> 00:39:04.595 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n从这儿看，全城看似很平静\n\nsrc-370\n00:39:04.697 --> 00:39:08.807 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n由1353英尺高空看下去\n什么也似很平静\n\nsrc-371\n00:39:09.243 --> 00:39:16.125 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我好像看到老爸\n- 我们还有很多事要做，走吧\n\nsrc-372\n00:39:16.273 --> 00:39:21.528 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这混蛋一定在某处\n\nsrc-373\n00:39:42.275 --> 00:39:46.595 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你想不想结婚？\n- 想\n\nsrc-374\n00:39:46.613 --> 00:39:51.266 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就在今天？我是认真的\n\nsrc-375\n00:39:51.284 --> 00:39:55.854 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我不想结婚\n- 为什么？\n\nsrc-376\n00:39:55.938 --> 00:40:00.817 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 考虑一下\n- 我除了太年轻……\n\nsrc-377\n00:40:00.834 --> 00:40:03.504 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n又没地方住……\n\nsrc-378\n00:40:03.612 --> 00:40:07.466 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你亦会成为唯一有丈夫的\n啦啦队队员外……\n\nsrc-379\n00:40:07.616 --> 00:40:12.579 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 说出一个为何不好的理由\n- 看我的父母便可以\n\nsrc-380\n00:40:14.348 --> 00:40:18.477 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他们讨厌对方\n- 那又怎样？\n\nsrc-381\n00:40:18.726 --> 00:40:23.632 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就像那辆法拉利\n他爱那法拉利，却讨厌妻子\n\nsrc-382\n00:40:31.974 --> 00:40:33.533 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢\n\nsrc-383\n00:40:48.991 --> 00:40:53.287 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n可否离开这里？\n这儿令我毛骨悚然\n\nsrc-384\n00:40:55.247 --> 00:40:58.098 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n为何不早说我们要往……\n\nsrc-385\n00:40:59.793 --> 00:41:03.297 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 请问有什么可以效劳？\n- 有的\n\nsrc-386\n00:41:03.463 --> 00:41:07.649 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我是霍艾比，订了12时，三位\n\nsrc-387\n00:41:11.096 --> 00:41:15.684 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 有问题吗？\n- 你是霍艾比？\n\nsrc-388\n00:41:15.767 --> 00:41:22.830 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 芝加哥香肠大王？\n- 本人正是\n\nsrc-389\n00:41:23.038 --> 00:41:29.086 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我很忙碌，你们返回俱乐部吧\n\nsrc-390\n00:41:29.336 --> 00:41:33.327 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你以为我并非霍艾比？\n\nsrc-391\n00:41:33.410 --> 00:41:38.803 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你们最好在我发火前离开\n\nsrc-392\n00:41:39.012 --> 00:41:42.974 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 艾比，走吧\n- 我不会走的\n\nsrc-393\n00:41:43.183 --> 00:41:50.260 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 请带我们就座\n- 我要报警了\n\nsrc-394\n00:41:50.344 --> 00:41:53.514 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你要报警？\n- 是的\n\nsrc-395\n00:41:53.889 --> 00:41:58.490 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 好极，让我亲自动手\n- 好的\n\nsrc-396\n00:41:59.895 --> 00:42:03.357 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n报警吧，你们定会成为笑柄\n\nsrc-397\n00:42:09.863 --> 00:42:14.296 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n拿电话来，有来电\n\nsrc-398\n00:42:14.505 --> 00:42:19.039 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你敢碰我，我就大喊有老鼠\n找找看别的电话\n\nsrc-399\n00:42:19.122 --> 00:42:21.720 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好极了\n\nsrc-400\n00:42:22.751 --> 00:42:26.350 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我为未来悲哀\n\nsrc-401\n00:42:28.590 --> 00:42:33.397 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 费利，走吧\n- 你太过分了\n\nsrc-402\n00:42:33.606 --> 00:42:36.901 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你会被警察抓的\n\nsrc-403\n00:42:37.182 --> 00:42:42.521 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n首先，根本不存在“太过分”这回事\n而且我也不会被这种人抓到\n\nsrc-404\n00:42:42.938 --> 00:42:47.234 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 走吧，艾比\n- 请霍艾比听电话\n\nsrc-405\n00:42:47.317 --> 00:42:50.529 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>- 你好\n- 请替我找霍艾比？</c>\n\nsrc-406\n00:42:51.613 --> 00:42:57.619 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 芝加哥香肠大王\n- 让我找找看\n\nsrc-407\n00:42:57.703 --> 00:43:01.800 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 可否形容一下他的外貌？\n- 他穿皮夹克\n\nsrc-408\n00:43:01.967 --> 00:43:04.626 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n白色汗衫，冷背心\n\nsrc-409\n00:43:04.719 --> 00:43:07.931 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n十分之英俊\n\nsrc-410\n00:43:08.140 --> 00:43:12.227 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>- 请等一下\n- 劳驾</c>\n\nsrc-411\n00:43:23.103 --> 00:43:27.149 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>弗罗曼先生，我是芝加哥警局的彼得森警长</c>\n\nsrc-412\n00:43:30.903 --> 00:43:34.665 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 谢谢你明白事理\n- 别客气\n\nsrc-413\n00:43:34.874 --> 00:43:40.579 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n明白事理令我们这种人\n容忍像你这类人\n\nsrc-414\n00:43:44.291 --> 00:43:47.178 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 谢谢\n- 何足挂齿\n\nsrc-415\n00:43:50.130 --> 00:43:53.808 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n请慢用午餐\n\nsrc-416\n00:43:54.017 --> 00:43:57.103 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n宝贝，你真棒\n\nsrc-417\n00:44:05.896 --> 00:44:11.944 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦，你不该以为\n我们不会玩得开心\n\nsrc-418\n00:44:17.616 --> 00:44:22.412 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>或许我反应过激\n或许费利不是那么差劲</c>\n\nsrc-419\n00:44:22.955 --> 00:44:27.216 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>毕竟我得到车子，他只有电脑</c>\n\nsrc-420\n00:44:27.251 --> 00:44:33.180 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>但为何他可以随心所欲？</c>\n\nsrc-421\n00:44:33.388 --> 00:44:36.683 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>为何他的一切都那么顺利？</c>\n\nsrc-422\n00:44:36.844 --> 00:44:39.847 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>他有啥特别？</c>\n\nsrc-423\n00:44:40.389 --> 00:44:42.182 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n去死吧\n\nsrc-424\n00:44:42.391 --> 00:44:48.694 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我还以为只有我家是怪家庭\n\nsrc-425\n00:44:48.814 --> 00:44:54.152 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n跟着我看到马伦的家\n他的家庭生活实在匪夷所思\n\nsrc-426\n00:44:54.617 --> 00:44:58.282 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n所以他老是生病\n他的家庭生活困扰着他\n\nsrc-427\n00:44:58.740 --> 00:45:02.208 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>他病倒反而觉得更好</c>\n\nsrc-428\n00:45:02.416 --> 00:45:07.040 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若我住在他的家\n我也恨不得快些病倒\n\nsrc-429\n00:45:07.505 --> 00:45:12.629 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那儿就像博物馆，很美，很冷\n\nsrc-430\n00:45:12.880 --> 00:45:15.591 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你不许碰任何东西\n\nsrc-431\n00:45:16.012 --> 00:45:21.847 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若你是个婴孩\n住在那里会怎样呢？\n\nsrc-432\n00:45:21.893 --> 00:45:29.776 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>能把车开出车库我自己都惊讶\n我也见过卡梅隆有一两次其实很享受兜风</c>\n\nsrc-433\n00:45:29.943 --> 00:45:33.650 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这次这经验有助他\n应付自己的恐惧\n\nsrc-434\n00:45:35.611 --> 00:45:38.530 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n还有，坦白说……\n\nsrc-435\n00:45:38.739 --> 00:45:42.284 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我爱驾驶它，那是多么有型\n\nsrc-436\n00:45:42.618 --> 00:45:47.460 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我强烈建议你们\n也试找辆来驾驶一下\n\nsrc-437\n00:45:47.915 --> 00:45:51.589 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 劳驾\n- 谢谢\n\nsrc-438\n00:46:02.932 --> 00:46:05.724 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n珍妮，又有谁烦着你？\n\nsrc-439\n00:46:05.891 --> 00:46:09.269 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 鲁尼先生在吗？\n- 不在，我可以帮忙吗？\n\nsrc-440\n00:46:09.272 --> 00:46:13.565 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 没有，他何时会回来？\n- 不晓得\n\nsrc-441\n00:46:13.607 --> 00:46:17.697 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他因私务外出\n- 什么意思？\n\nsrc-442\n00:46:17.906 --> 00:46:22.407 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n即是说不关你的事\n\nsrc-443\n00:46:24.326 --> 00:46:26.331 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n态度真好\n\nsrc-444\n00:46:26.581 --> 00:46:31.502 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你不是要上夏太太的课吗？\n- 也许是吧\n\nsrc-445\n00:46:35.881 --> 00:46:38.465 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n真讨厌\n\nsrc-446\n00:46:38.467 --> 00:46:43.220 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 增加你们的广告预算\n- 我们没有钱\n\nsrc-447\n00:46:43.387 --> 00:46:47.976 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有付出才有收获，就这么简单\n\nsrc-448\n00:46:48.185 --> 00:46:52.688 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这区有4000间食肆\n我偏选中我爸吃午餐那一间\n\nsrc-449\n00:46:52.813 --> 00:46:55.315 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们这次死定了\n\nsrc-450\n00:46:55.357 --> 00:46:59.862 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n胆小的人才会死\n勇敢的人会活下来，走吧\n\nsrc-451\n00:46:59.945 --> 00:47:03.032 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我们投降吧\n- 绝对不行\n\nsrc-452\n00:47:07.619 --> 00:47:12.124 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n大卫，事情并非这样\n\nsrc-453\n00:47:12.207 --> 00:47:19.006 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我们没有钱\n- 大卫，你也知道要多少钱啊\n\nsrc-454\n00:47:19.464 --> 00:47:23.927 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们会集中在电视上宣传\n亦会在电台和报刊卖广告\n\nsrc-455\n00:47:24.136 --> 00:47:26.889 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n来我的办公室\n\nsrc-456\n00:47:27.305 --> 00:47:31.101 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们知道他是有钱的\n只是不肯花费\n\nsrc-457\n00:48:25.614 --> 00:48:27.489 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>布费利</c>\n\nsrc-458\n00:48:38.627 --> 00:48:44.087 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>即是说你完蛋了</c>\n\nsrc-459\n00:48:44.296 --> 00:48:47.716 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你屁股要开花了\n\nsrc-460\n00:49:14.746 --> 00:49:18.246 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>跑垒者在一垒，没有人出局</c>\n\nsrc-461\n00:49:18.292 --> 00:49:25.299 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>这是第五局的首个安打\n亦是全场比赛的第四个安打</c>\n\nsrc-462\n00:49:27.009 --> 00:49:31.509 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>球数两好零坏\n强劲击球飞向左外野，偏出界外</c>\n\nsrc-463\n00:49:31.717 --> 00:49:35.142 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>出界</c>\n\nsrc-464\n00:49:37.186 --> 00:49:42.524 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>他们竟在那局不思进取</c>\n\nsrc-465\n00:49:42.936 --> 00:49:45.527 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 比数是？\n- 0比0\n\nsrc-466\n00:49:45.819 --> 00:49:50.032 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 谁领先？\n- 熊队\n\nsrc-467\n00:50:05.047 --> 00:50:10.135 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我的拇指好像断了\n- 挥棒……击球……\n\nsrc-468\n00:50:17.142 --> 00:50:21.015 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n救救费利\n\nsrc-469\n00:50:21.223 --> 00:50:27.061 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若我们循规蹈矩的话\n现在应在上体育课\n\nsrc-470\n00:50:36.161 --> 00:50:39.240 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n来，努力\n\nsrc-471\n00:50:39.248 --> 00:50:42.827 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你们休想离开这里，快跑！\n\nsrc-472\n00:50:51.093 --> 00:50:52.879 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我讨厌他\n\nsrc-473\n00:51:34.511 --> 00:51:37.463 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>谁呀？</c>\n\nsrc-474\n00:51:42.227 --> 00:51:45.480 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是罗艾华，我想跟你谈谈\n\nsrc-475\n00:51:45.939 --> 00:51:51.320 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>抱歉，我不能出来\n我的情况很坏……</c>\n\nsrc-476\n00:51:51.403 --> 00:51:56.606 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>下楼梯时我可能会跌倒\n并要多休息数天</c>\n\nsrc-477\n00:51:56.742 --> 00:52:01.413 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 少来这套，下来\n- 到我父母工作的公司找他们\n\nsrc-478\n00:52:01.496 --> 00:52:06.074 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢你来看我，谢谢关心\n\nsrc-479\n00:52:06.324 --> 00:52:11.924 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 下来，我有话要跟你说\n- 再见\n\nsrc-480\n00:52:12.090 --> 00:52:15.219 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你有天大麻烦了\n\nsrc-481\n00:52:17.721 --> 00:52:19.712 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>费利</c>\n\nsrc-482\n00:52:19.920 --> 00:52:22.631 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利\n\nsrc-483\n00:52:31.527 --> 00:52:34.947 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 谁呀？\n- 是谁你该心知肚明\n\nsrc-484\n00:52:35.239 --> 00:52:40.744 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>抱歉，我不能出来\n我的情况很坏……</c>\n\nsrc-485\n00:52:40.827 --> 00:52:46.237 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>下楼梯时我可能会跌倒\n并要多休息数天</c>\n\nsrc-486\n00:52:47.459 --> 00:52:50.087 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>请到我父母工作的公司找他们</c>\n\nsrc-487\n00:52:53.036 --> 00:52:58.136 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>谢谢你来看我，谢谢关心</c>\n\nsrc-488\n00:52:59.680 --> 00:53:02.462 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>再见</c>\n\nsrc-489\n00:53:22.397 --> 00:53:24.817 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n尽是泥……\n\nsrc-490\n00:53:51.732 --> 00:53:54.735 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n讨厌\n\nsrc-491\n00:54:04.229 --> 00:54:07.232 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我的鞋子\n\nsrc-492\n00:55:44.178 --> 00:55:47.328 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n小狗，你好\n\nsrc-493\n00:55:50.934 --> 00:55:53.459 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n别动\n\nsrc-494\n00:55:53.687 --> 00:55:56.796 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n别动……\n别动\n\nsrc-495\n00:55:57.046 --> 00:55:59.298 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n坐下\n\nsrc-496\n00:56:01.278 --> 00:56:05.490 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n坐下，蹲着，别动\n\nadd-agy-en-781\n00:58:03.692 --> 00:58:05.944 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>现在正经过检阅台的是，</c>\n\nadd-agy-en-782\n00:58:07.404 --> 00:58:09.865 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>银色骑士鼓号乐队。</c>\n\nadd-agy-en-783\n00:58:12.492 --> 00:58:16.330 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>全美德裔男女联合会。</c>\n\nadd-agy-en-784\n00:58:16.413 --> 00:58:18.415 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>帝国德裔美国人协会。</c>\n\nsrc-497\n00:58:27.132 --> 00:58:32.554 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 还是快点去取车吧\n- 六点才到时间呢\n\nsrc-498\n00:58:32.638 --> 00:58:39.202 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我知道你根本不在乎\n但这可是要我的命\n\nsrc-499\n00:58:39.453 --> 00:58:42.731 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你这样说我很伤心\n\nsrc-500\n00:58:43.957 --> 00:58:47.778 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你今天看到什么？\n- 没什么好的\n\nsrc-501\n00:58:47.919 --> 00:58:54.258 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n没什么？你这是什么意思？\n\nsrc-502\n00:58:54.425 --> 00:58:58.512 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们什么好东西都见过了\n我们走遍了全城\n\nsrc-503\n00:58:58.721 --> 00:59:02.918 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们去过博物馆\n看到很多无价艺术品\n\nsrc-504\n00:59:04.769 --> 00:59:08.397 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n什么事？有何不妥？\n\nsrc-505\n00:59:13.778 --> 00:59:16.890 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看那边\n\nsrc-506\n00:59:49.256 --> 00:59:54.178 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他在做什么？\n- 他在舔玻璃，还做下流手势\n\nsrc-507\n00:59:54.261 --> 00:59:56.151 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n什么\n\nsrc-508\n01:00:05.619 --> 01:00:09.443 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n病态年轻人在社区结集\n\nsrc-509\n01:00:33.396 --> 01:00:37.471 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他没有离开\n- 很拥挤\n\nsrc-510\n01:00:37.721 --> 01:00:43.155 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他不会丢下我们的\n- 他或许已返回学校\n\nsrc-511\n01:00:43.363 --> 01:00:51.068 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他不会返回学校的\n- 他这样做以令我不安\n\nsrc-512\n01:00:51.151 --> 01:00:56.406 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n各位，我们想为大家演奏\n\nsrc-513\n01:00:56.793 --> 01:01:04.049 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我把这曲送给一位\n以为今天不好玩的男士\n\nsrc-514\n01:01:04.258 --> 01:01:07.178 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n范马伦，这曲是送给你的\n\nsrc-515\n01:01:13.642 --> 01:01:17.344 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 下来吧\n- 你在做什么？\n\nsrc-516\n01:01:58.602 --> 01:02:03.315 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他做每一件事都那么顺利\n\nsrc-517\n01:02:03.565 --> 01:02:07.986 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n没什么事他处理不了\n我则什么也处理不了\n\nsrc-518\n01:02:08.020 --> 01:02:13.692 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n学校、父母、未来\n费利无所不能\n\nsrc-519\n01:02:17.237 --> 01:02:22.625 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我不知道自己未来该做什么\n- 上大学\n\nsrc-520\n01:02:22.834 --> 01:02:25.837 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是的，但上大学做什么？\n\nsrc-521\n01:02:28.123 --> 01:02:31.759 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你对什么有兴趣？\n\nsrc-522\n01:02:33.086 --> 01:02:36.264 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n对什么也没兴趣\n\nsrc-523\n01:02:36.381 --> 01:02:39.308 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我也是\n\nsrc-524\n01:02:44.848 --> 01:02:47.024 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你疯了\n\nsrc-525\n01:02:48.936 --> 01:02:52.946 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你认为费利会做什么？\n\nsrc-526\n01:02:53.190 --> 01:02:57.367 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他会成为厨师\n\nsrc-527\n01:05:46.405 --> 01:05:51.618 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n祝早日康复\n英文系职员上\n\nsrc-528\n01:05:53.161 --> 01:05:54.955 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n老天……\n\nsrc-529\n01:06:02.087 --> 01:06:07.342 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看艾华叔叔有什么给你\n\nsrc-530\n01:06:14.432 --> 01:06:17.310 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n天啊\n\nsrc-531\n01:06:17.603 --> 01:06:20.480 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n救救费利\n\nsrc-532\n01:06:23.275 --> 01:06:26.026 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n安睡吧\n\nsrc-533\n01:06:50.675 --> 01:06:53.052 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我早知道是这样\n\nsrc-534\n01:07:03.273 --> 01:07:07.110 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n她在哪儿？我是她的女儿\n\nsrc-535\n01:07:11.990 --> 01:07:16.491 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n知不知道她在哪里？何时回来\n\nsrc-536\n01:07:16.787 --> 01:07:19.911 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你究竟知道什么？\n\nsrc-537\n01:08:07.874 --> 01:08:11.920 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 费利\n- 布\n\nsrc-538\n01:08:32.988 --> 01:08:36.610 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你这疯子，你完全疯了\n\nsrc-539\n01:08:36.819 --> 01:08:41.407 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你竟然上了巡游车队\n\nsrc-540\n01:08:41.662 --> 01:08:44.207 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n慢着\n\nsrc-541\n01:08:44.750 --> 01:08:50.421 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这曲是我的至爱\n\nsrc-542\n01:08:50.506 --> 01:08:54.843 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 有很多人会看到你啊\n- 你死定了\n\nsrc-543\n01:08:54.926 --> 01:08:57.797 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有谁会相信我参加巡游？\n\nsrc-544\n01:08:58.005 --> 01:09:03.519 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n要抓我的人都不会参加巡游\n\nsrc-545\n01:09:03.602 --> 01:09:06.472 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n很快啊\n\nsrc-546\n01:09:09.983 --> 01:09:14.605 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我觉得没有不妥\n- 似乎没什么，走吧\n\nsrc-547\n01:09:14.988 --> 01:09:17.783 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n给你的，劳驾\n\nsrc-548\n01:09:17.866 --> 01:09:23.614 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你真慷慨，请随时回来光顾\n\nsrc-549\n01:09:23.823 --> 01:09:26.825 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 小心座位\n- 对不起\n\nsrc-550\n01:09:32.664 --> 01:09:36.009 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n再见\n\nsrc-551\n01:09:39.212 --> 01:09:42.265 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们一定要再来一次\n\nsrc-552\n01:09:44.926 --> 01:09:49.389 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我并非报假案\n的确有人闯入屋\n\nsrc-553\n01:09:49.598 --> 01:09:54.736 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是白种男性\n在厨房里，可能有枪\n\nsrc-554\n01:09:55.112 --> 01:09:58.647 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我姓布\n\nsrc-555\n01:09:59.732 --> 01:10:03.778 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你希望我弟弟快些康复？\n我现在有危险\n\nsrc-556\n01:10:03.986 --> 01:10:10.627 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我很爱惜自己身体\n不想受伤或被杀\n\nsrc-557\n01:10:10.752 --> 01:10:13.162 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我需要帮忙\n\nsrc-558\n01:10:13.255 --> 01:10:17.509 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你懂英语吗？笨蛋\n\nsrc-559\n01:10:30.522 --> 01:10:36.570 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>若你仍在屋子里\n告诉你我已报警</c>\n\nsrc-560\n01:10:36.653 --> 01:10:42.357 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>若你懂得想的话，就立即离开</c>\n\nsrc-561\n01:10:42.534 --> 01:10:47.778 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我手上还有我爸的手枪\n而且我得了严重的疱疹</c>\n\nsrc-562\n01:10:55.797 --> 01:10:59.373 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n慢着，那是我的车子\n别拖走它\n\nsrc-563\n01:11:01.720 --> 01:11:05.462 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他拿了我的车钥匙\n\nsrc-564\n01:11:05.557 --> 01:11:08.257 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你这呆子\n\nsrc-565\n01:11:18.474 --> 01:11:21.949 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我觉得很好，真的\n\nsrc-566\n01:11:22.032 --> 01:11:26.995 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n车库里的人十分好\n我之前确有点担心他们\n\nsrc-567\n01:11:27.150 --> 01:11:30.278 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但结果一切都很好\n\nsrc-568\n01:11:34.211 --> 01:11:37.117 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n喂\n\nsrc-569\n01:11:39.758 --> 01:11:42.497 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 马伦\n- 什么事？\n\nsrc-570\n01:11:42.511 --> 01:11:46.626 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们离开时车子走了多少里？\n\nsrc-571\n01:11:46.640 --> 01:11:51.673 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n126又3/10至4/10里左右\n\nsrc-572\n01:11:51.840 --> 01:11:56.470 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n为何这样问？现在里数多少？\n\nsrc-573\n01:12:00.474 --> 01:12:03.282 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦就在这时爆发了\n\nsrc-574\n01:12:22.843 --> 01:12:26.221 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦，你没事吧？\n\nsrc-575\n01:12:26.332 --> 01:12:29.751 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n别这样\n\nsrc-576\n01:12:31.711 --> 01:12:33.797 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>谁呀？</c>\n\nsrc-577\n01:12:34.047 --> 01:12:40.194 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>抱歉，我不能出来\n我的情况很坏……</c>\n\nsrc-578\n01:12:40.277 --> 01:12:43.030 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>下楼梯时我可能会跌倒……</c>\n\nsrc-579\n01:12:43.113 --> 01:12:48.728 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n太好了，我有救了\n谢天谢地\n\nsrc-580\n01:12:49.953 --> 01:12:54.791 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 谢谢……\n- 听说你不舒服\n\nsrc-581\n01:12:54.875 --> 01:12:58.003 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>头痛、发烧又发冷</c>\n\nsrc-582\n01:12:58.086 --> 01:13:01.298 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>我是来令你回复健康的</c>\n\nsrc-583\n01:13:01.381 --> 01:13:04.343 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n<c.italic>因为我是护士……</c>\n\nsrc-584\n01:13:11.225 --> 01:13:14.753 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n似乎是真的\n\nsrc-585\n01:13:14.937 --> 01:13:18.190 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他可能真的傻了\n\nsrc-586\n01:13:18.257 --> 01:13:23.529 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他一向紧张兮兮\n我只想令他放松一天\n\nsrc-587\n01:13:23.970 --> 01:13:27.491 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们快毕业了\n\nsrc-588\n01:13:27.598 --> 01:13:32.770 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n到暑假时，他和我都会工作\n\nsrc-589\n01:13:32.829 --> 01:13:36.524 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们会在晚上和周末见面\n\nsrc-590\n01:13:36.733 --> 01:13:40.445 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n跟着我们会分别到\n不同学校升学\n\nsrc-591\n01:13:40.462 --> 01:13:43.865 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n基本上是这样\n\nsrc-592\n01:13:45.884 --> 01:13:48.869 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n思朗则是一个大问题\n\nsrc-593\n01:13:49.346 --> 01:13:53.749 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n她尚有一年才高中毕业\n我该怎处理呢？\n\nsrc-594\n01:13:53.957 --> 01:13:58.336 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我跟她求婚时是认真的\n\nsrc-595\n01:13:58.522 --> 01:14:01.048 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦？\n\nsrc-596\n01:14:01.256 --> 01:14:05.510 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你听不听到？\n\nsrc-597\n01:14:05.719 --> 01:14:10.284 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若明白的话就眨眼\n\nsrc-598\n01:14:10.640 --> 01:14:15.831 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦从没谈过恋爱\n从没有人爱上他\n\nsrc-599\n01:14:16.145 --> 01:14:22.276 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若情况没改善\n他将与首个上床的女孩结婚\n\nsrc-600\n01:14:22.296 --> 01:14:27.031 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n她会视他如粪土，更会令他……\n\nsrc-601\n01:14:27.239 --> 01:14:32.703 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n噩梦成真，即是世界末日\n\nsrc-602\n01:14:32.723 --> 01:14:35.331 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n她不会尊重他\n\nsrc-603\n01:14:35.539 --> 01:14:40.669 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n因为你不会尊重奉承你的人\n\nsrc-604\n01:14:40.856 --> 01:14:45.340 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n试别的方法吧，这样没效\n\nsrc-605\n01:14:51.012 --> 01:14:53.848 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦，你好了点没有？\n\nsrc-606\n01:14:55.954 --> 01:15:00.480 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n进来，很舒服啊\n\nsrc-607\n01:15:03.420 --> 01:15:08.904 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不要紧，我也很容易发疯\n\nsrc-608\n01:15:10.135 --> 01:15:14.827 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n迟早所有人都会发疯\n\nsrc-609\n01:15:18.894 --> 01:15:24.525 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n或许他真的有病\n他并非在折磨自己\n\nsrc-610\n01:16:09.069 --> 01:16:12.614 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦\n\nsrc-611\n01:16:12.674 --> 01:16:17.596 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦，醒来\n\nsrc-612\n01:16:17.870 --> 01:16:22.726 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n来，马伦，快醒吧\n\nsrc-613\n01:16:26.587 --> 01:16:32.026 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 怎么了？\n- 布费利，你实在是我的英雄\n\nsrc-614\n01:16:32.276 --> 01:16:36.513 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你确很重视我啊\n- 你这畜牲\n\nsrc-615\n01:16:44.288 --> 01:16:46.773 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n一点也不好笑\n\nsrc-616\n01:17:13.008 --> 01:17:16.653 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n毒品？\n\nsrc-617\n01:17:16.762 --> 01:17:19.614 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢，但我不吸毒的\n\nsrc-618\n01:17:19.640 --> 01:17:22.991 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我是问你是否因毒品被抓？\n\nsrc-619\n01:17:24.702 --> 01:17:27.371 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你为何在这里？\n- 因为毒品\n\nsrc-620\n01:17:27.579 --> 01:17:31.500 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我不知道自己为何在这里\n- 你为何不回家？\n\nsrc-621\n01:17:31.709 --> 01:17:36.296 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你为何要多管闲事？\n\nsrc-622\n01:17:41.078 --> 01:17:44.263 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你的眼部化妆太浓\n\nsrc-623\n01:17:47.181 --> 01:17:52.130 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我姐姐化妆太浓\n人们以为她是妓女\n\nsrc-624\n01:17:57.358 --> 01:18:01.529 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你不想跟我谈谈你的问题吗？\n- 跟你谈？你说真的？\n\nsrc-625\n01:18:01.738 --> 01:18:05.394 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 当然\n- 你去死吧\n\nsrc-626\n01:18:09.704 --> 01:18:14.416 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好，你想知道问题出于哪里？\n\nsrc-627\n01:18:14.528 --> 01:18:18.198 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我知道问题出于那里\n但我想听你说出来\n\nsrc-628\n01:18:18.545 --> 01:18:22.424 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n总言之，我讨厌我的弟弟\n\nsrc-629\n01:18:22.632 --> 01:18:27.137 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你把他干掉了？\n\nsrc-630\n01:18:27.345 --> 01:18:30.724 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不，还未\n\nsrc-631\n01:18:31.920 --> 01:18:37.676 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他逃学，当我回家查看时\n有人在屋里\n\nsrc-632\n01:18:37.759 --> 01:18:41.138 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n警察以为我报假案所以抓我\n\nsrc-633\n01:18:41.150 --> 01:18:45.571 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你的弟弟逃学又与你何干？\n\nsrc-634\n01:18:45.642 --> 01:18:49.784 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 人人都上学\n- 你自己也可以逃学\n\nsrc-635\n01:18:50.034 --> 01:18:55.414 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我会被发现的\n- 说得对\n\nsrc-636\n01:18:55.581 --> 01:19:00.753 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你愤怒的原因是\n他逃学又没被发现？\n\nsrc-637\n01:19:02.534 --> 01:19:04.965 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 基本上是的\n- 基本上是的\n\nsrc-638\n01:19:05.174 --> 01:19:10.220 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 那问题出于你自己身上\n- 什么？\n\nsrc-639\n01:19:10.428 --> 01:19:16.006 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你该担心自己\n而非担心你弟弟做什么\n\nsrc-640\n01:19:17.382 --> 01:19:21.970 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 那不过是我个人见解\n- 你是何许人？心理学家吗？\n\nsrc-641\n01:19:22.095 --> 01:19:25.735 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n请别意见多多\n\nsrc-642\n01:19:28.852 --> 01:19:32.200 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你该跟某人好好谈谈\n\nsrc-643\n01:19:35.327 --> 01:19:38.789 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若你是指费利，省一口气吧\n\nsrc-644\n01:19:38.997 --> 01:19:41.458 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n原来你认识他\n\nsrc-645\n01:19:49.591 --> 01:19:53.429 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那时候我不断想\n希望一切都结束\n\nsrc-646\n01:19:55.504 --> 01:19:59.174 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我就像……在冥想\n\nsrc-647\n01:20:02.177 --> 01:20:05.273 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我好像看到自己的内心\n\nsrc-648\n01:20:07.391 --> 01:20:12.280 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我发现害怕实在……太荒谬了\n\nsrc-649\n01:20:12.488 --> 01:20:16.492 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n杞人忧天，希望自己死了等等\n\nsrc-650\n01:20:16.701 --> 01:20:19.996 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我已厌倦了这样子\n\nsrc-651\n01:20:22.364 --> 01:20:26.251 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n今天是我一生最精彩一天\n\nsrc-652\n01:20:29.254 --> 01:20:32.966 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n明年我将会怀念你们\n\nsrc-653\n01:20:40.841 --> 01:20:46.021 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦，可否问你一条问题？\n\nsrc-654\n01:20:46.388 --> 01:20:49.191 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n问吧\n\nsrc-655\n01:20:49.399 --> 01:20:54.320 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你有没有偷看我更衣？\n\nsrc-656\n01:20:55.689 --> 01:20:58.699 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有没有？\n\nsrc-657\n01:20:59.359 --> 01:21:03.071 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你偷看我？\n我还以为你患上紧张症\n\nsrc-658\n01:21:07.249 --> 01:21:12.664 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不要紧，我并不尴尬\n\nsrc-659\n01:21:15.000 --> 01:21:18.510 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我还是去看看那辆法拉利\n\nsrc-660\n01:21:30.974 --> 01:21:33.733 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利\n\nsrc-661\n01:21:34.186 --> 01:21:36.695 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n什么事？\n\nsrc-662\n01:21:37.737 --> 01:21:43.946 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们倒行，但里数并没倒退\n\nsrc-663\n01:21:48.075 --> 01:21:52.835 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n真的？那么有麻烦了\n\nsrc-664\n01:21:53.043 --> 01:21:57.167 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们得弄开里程计\n以人手把里数倒退\n\nsrc-665\n01:21:58.257 --> 01:22:01.093 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不，不用了\n\nsrc-666\n01:22:02.214 --> 01:22:05.264 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不用了\n\nsrc-667\n01:22:09.471 --> 01:22:11.811 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我要勇敢站起来\n\nsrc-668\n01:22:15.894 --> 01:22:18.901 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我是窝囊废\n\nsrc-669\n01:22:21.358 --> 01:22:24.907 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我什么也哑忍\n\nsrc-670\n01:22:27.865 --> 01:22:30.909 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n被老父操纵\n\nsrc-671\n01:22:33.412 --> 01:22:36.753 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我从来没有发言权\n\nsrc-672\n01:22:40.419 --> 01:22:44.718 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有问题的不是他，是我\n\nsrc-673\n01:22:49.845 --> 01:22:53.101 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我得有立场\n\nsrc-674\n01:22:54.933 --> 01:22:57.731 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我得站起来对抗他\n\nsrc-675\n01:23:00.230 --> 01:23:02.983 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我不会坐以待毙……\n\nsrc-676\n01:23:03.692 --> 01:23:08.906 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不会任由宰割\n\nsrc-677\n01:23:10.449 --> 01:23:13.621 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我要站起来保护自己\n\nsrc-678\n01:23:13.702 --> 01:23:18.209 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n无论对与错\n我也要保护自己的原则\n\nsrc-679\n01:23:28.008 --> 01:23:30.887 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我已厌了这废铁\n\nsrc-680\n01:23:31.178 --> 01:23:34.097 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我再不能忍受他\n我讨厌他的车子\n\nsrc-681\n01:23:34.389 --> 01:23:38.311 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你爱谁？你爱上一辆车\n\nsrc-682\n01:23:38.644 --> 01:23:41.606 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你这畜牲\n\nsrc-683\n01:24:03.544 --> 01:24:05.504 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n糟了\n\nsrc-684\n01:24:07.381 --> 01:24:10.843 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我把他的爱车弄成这样子\n\nsrc-685\n01:24:14.179 --> 01:24:16.432 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好极\n\nsrc-686\n01:24:19.268 --> 01:24:23.312 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我爸会看到我做过什么\n\nsrc-687\n01:24:25.899 --> 01:24:30.445 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他回家之后就得跟我算账\n\nsrc-688\n01:24:30.821 --> 01:24:33.948 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我不管，我真的不管\n\nsrc-689\n01:24:34.032 --> 01:24:38.077 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我已厌了担惊受怕\n\nsrc-690\n01:24:43.876 --> 01:24:46.878 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n管他的\n\nsrc-691\n01:24:49.047 --> 01:24:52.341 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我恨不得快些看到他样子\n\nsrc-692\n01:25:21.872 --> 01:25:24.663 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我做了什么？\n\nsrc-693\n01:25:33.422 --> 01:25:38.928 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我做了什么？\n- 你把车子变成废铁\n\nsrc-694\n01:26:16.593 --> 01:26:19.091 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n哗\n\nsrc-695\n01:26:20.472 --> 01:26:23.137 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n老天\n\nsrc-696\n01:26:36.482 --> 01:26:40.576 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这是我的错，我会承担责任\n\nsrc-697\n01:26:40.659 --> 01:26:46.701 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他回家后，对他说是我做的\n反正他一直讨厌我\n\nsrc-698\n01:26:50.872 --> 01:26:53.750 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不，让我负责任\n\nsrc-699\n01:26:53.958 --> 01:26:58.468 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 让我来吧\n- 但这次非同小可\n\nsrc-700\n01:26:58.594 --> 01:27:02.347 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若我怕负责\n就不会让你驶走那辆车\n\nsrc-701\n01:27:02.431 --> 01:27:09.306 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 是我令你驶走那辆车的\n- 我大可以阻止你\n\nsrc-702\n01:27:09.730 --> 01:27:13.066 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就让我承担责任吧\n\nsrc-703\n01:27:13.942 --> 01:27:19.489 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n摩利回家后，我们会好好谈谈\n\nsrc-704\n01:27:21.408 --> 01:27:25.454 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n妙极，不，真的棒极\n\nsrc-705\n01:27:26.997 --> 01:27:29.450 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢你\n\nsrc-706\n01:27:37.216 --> 01:27:41.470 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我很震惊\n首先，我不知为何她不在学校\n\nsrc-707\n01:27:41.553 --> 01:27:46.141 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n亦不知为何她会编出\n有人闯入的故事\n\nsrc-708\n01:27:46.475 --> 01:27:50.562 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n无论为什么，她确受了惊\n\nsrc-709\n01:27:50.596 --> 01:27:57.861 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢你来电\n我们会好好跟她谈谈\n\nsrc-710\n01:27:57.945 --> 01:28:00.271 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n谢谢\n\nsrc-711\n01:28:00.531 --> 01:28:04.067 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 希望令郎快点康复\n- 什么？\n\nsrc-712\n01:28:04.493 --> 01:28:08.530 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n转告他警局内的人都为他打气\n\nsrc-713\n01:28:08.747 --> 01:28:11.616 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好的\n\nsrc-714\n01:28:19.299 --> 01:28:22.084 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 嗨\n- 别“嗨”我\n\nsrc-715\n01:28:22.344 --> 01:28:25.629 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我想立即离开这里\n\nsrc-716\n01:28:25.796 --> 01:28:29.049 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好的……\n\nsrc-717\n01:28:35.806 --> 01:28:40.060 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 她有点神经过敏\n- 是的\n\nsrc-718\n01:28:42.906 --> 01:28:47.317 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们还是不要滔滔不绝说下去\n\nsrc-719\n01:28:47.661 --> 01:28:52.613 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你还没告诉我你名字\n- 我叫珍妮\n\nsrc-720\n01:28:52.822 --> 01:28:56.868 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但男孩大多叫我做桑娜\n\nsrc-721\n01:28:56.962 --> 01:29:00.997 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 好的，珍妮\n- 好极\n\nsrc-722\n01:29:01.258 --> 01:29:03.875 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好\n\nsrc-723\n01:29:04.083 --> 01:29:07.587 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n迟些见\n\nsrc-724\n01:29:10.809 --> 01:29:13.395 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n珍妮，走吧\n\nsrc-725\n01:29:13.478 --> 01:29:16.523 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 立即\n- 好的\n\nsrc-726\n01:29:25.187 --> 01:29:29.953 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我今天玩得很开心\n- 的确不错\n\nsrc-727\n01:29:32.414 --> 01:29:34.833 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n马伦不会有事吧？\n\nsrc-728\n01:29:35.209 --> 01:29:39.534 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n一生以来第一次没有事\n\nsrc-729\n01:29:39.630 --> 01:29:42.370 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他不会有事的\n\nsrc-730\n01:29:49.085 --> 01:29:53.464 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你今早醒来时\n知否自己会做什么？\n\nsrc-731\n01:29:53.602 --> 01:29:56.509 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我？不知道\n\nsrc-732\n01:30:15.443 --> 01:30:17.404 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n糟了\n\nsrc-733\n01:30:17.612 --> 01:30:20.448 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我要走了\n\nsrc-734\n01:30:21.588 --> 01:30:24.744 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我今晚致电你\n- 好的\n\nsrc-735\n01:30:27.344 --> 01:30:31.459 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 我爱你\n- 我也爱你\n\nsrc-736\n01:30:31.765 --> 01:30:34.086 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他会跟我结婚\n\nsrc-737\n01:30:37.855 --> 01:30:43.861 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你知否往警局接女儿的滋味？\n\nsrc-738\n01:30:43.944 --> 01:30:50.242 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我本来快要跟\n佛蒙特的人达成协议\n\nsrc-739\n01:30:53.036 --> 01:30:57.109 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我本来快要收到佣金\n给你小弟买辆车\n\nsrc-740\n01:30:57.359 --> 01:31:01.946 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你究竟在搞什么？想拖垮全家\n\nsrc-741\n01:31:02.045 --> 01:31:06.633 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看这儿一团糟\n我怎也不能再整理好这些\n\nsrc-742\n01:31:25.027 --> 01:31:29.698 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 慢些\n- 你不断骂我，我驾不了车\n\nsrc-743\n01:31:59.210 --> 01:32:02.314 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你们好，我叫布费利\n\nsrc-744\n01:33:30.444 --> 01:33:34.510 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n别起来，很香\n\nsrc-745\n01:33:34.531 --> 01:33:38.097 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 晚餐准备好了\n- 什么？那是谁？\n\nsrc-746\n01:34:10.609 --> 01:34:13.130 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n有什么不妥？\n\nsrc-747\n01:34:13.445 --> 01:34:18.177 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n一切也不妥\n我刚往警局接珍妮回来\n\nsrc-748\n01:34:19.910 --> 01:34:24.850 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n她又吃了一张超速罚单\n我也因为她失去了佛蒙特那笔交易\n\nadd-agy-en-1150\n01:34:24.851 --> 01:34:26.687 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我看我们该毙了她。\n\nsrc-749\n01:34:32.339 --> 01:34:35.318 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n是否在找这个？\n\nsrc-750\n01:34:45.578 --> 01:34:48.123 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我抓到你了，费利\n\nsrc-751\n01:34:48.522 --> 01:34:52.609 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利怎样？我们去看看他吧\n\nsrc-752\n01:34:52.669 --> 01:34:59.800 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我一直梦想有这么一天\n而这次……\n\nsrc-753\n01:35:00.009 --> 01:35:04.997 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你这小鬼就被我人赃俱获\n\nsrc-754\n01:35:05.080 --> 01:35:07.975 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利，我们回家了\n\nsrc-755\n01:35:09.001 --> 01:35:16.358 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n留级一年，我亲自监督你\n\nsrc-756\n01:35:16.567 --> 01:35:21.322 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你觉得怎样？\n\nsrc-757\n01:35:21.530 --> 01:35:23.682 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你好\n\nsrc-758\n01:35:26.018 --> 01:35:30.872 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n幸好你没事，我们担心死了\n\nsrc-759\n01:35:34.500 --> 01:35:38.296 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n罗先生，谢谢你送他回家\n\nsrc-760\n01:35:38.504 --> 01:35:42.201 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n快上床睡觉\n\nsrc-761\n01:35:53.337 --> 01:35:55.854 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n快\n\nsrc-762\n01:35:56.089 --> 01:36:01.526 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他病得那么重\n竟还想由医院步行回家\n\nsrc-763\n01:36:01.845 --> 01:36:04.154 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n小孩子真是的\n\nsrc-764\n01:36:06.225 --> 01:36:10.312 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n顺便说一句，你把钱包落在了厨房地板上\n\nsrc-765\n01:37:16.712 --> 01:37:19.268 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n乖儿子\n\nsrc-766\n01:37:19.476 --> 01:37:23.355 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 他仍然很热\n- 你觉得怎样？\n\nsrc-767\n01:37:23.594 --> 01:37:27.234 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好得多\n\nsrc-768\n01:37:27.443 --> 01:37:33.657 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n别再要我留在家了，我要上学\n\nsrc-769\n01:37:33.979 --> 01:37:38.775 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我得在6月毕业，而且……\n\nsrc-770\n01:37:38.859 --> 01:37:43.958 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n费利，你有病，别勉强\n否则弄坏身体\n\nsrc-771\n01:37:44.167 --> 01:37:48.254 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 或许你说得对\n- 我当然说得对\n\nsrc-772\n01:37:48.463 --> 01:37:54.427 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n- 你怎么会这么乖？\n- 多年练出来的\n\nsrc-773\n01:38:04.259 --> 01:38:06.938 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n毛毯……\n\nsrc-774\n01:38:16.104 --> 01:38:18.325 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n快些休息\n\nsrc-775\n01:38:23.111 --> 01:38:28.669 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我安顿好后会弄碗汤给你\n\nsrc-776\n01:38:37.751 --> 01:38:43.599 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我之前已说过，并会再说一遍\n人生匆匆\n\nsrc-777\n01:38:43.808 --> 01:38:49.021 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若你不偶尔停下来周围看看\n你会错过很多事\n\nsrc-778\n01:38:59.064 --> 01:39:02.367 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n四年来我一直盯紧这小子\n\nsrc-779\n01:39:02.401 --> 01:39:07.122 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n四年来我都遭他愚弄\n\nsrc-780\n01:39:16.456 --> 01:39:20.544 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n罗先生，发生什么事？\n\nsrc-781\n01:39:22.553 --> 01:39:26.473 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你跟人打架？\n\nsrc-782\n01:39:26.800 --> 01:39:30.060 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n要不要我载你一程？\n\nsrc-783\n01:41:13.994 --> 01:41:17.911 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我敢说你以前肯定没闻过真正的校车味吧？\n\nsrc-784\n01:41:31.800 --> 01:41:34.722 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n吃小熊软糖吗？\n\nsrc-785\n01:41:34.888 --> 01:41:39.018 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n它们一直在我口袋里\n又暖又软\n\nsrc-786\n01:41:47.774 --> 01:41:49.526 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n鲁尼吃屎\n\nsrc-787\n01:42:01.413 --> 01:42:03.498 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n救救费利\n\nsrc-788\n01:42:25.812 --> 01:42:28.940 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n你们还在？\n\nsrc-789\n01:42:30.275 --> 01:42:33.195 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n故事完了\n\nsrc-790\n01:42:33.487 --> 01:42:35.989 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n回家吧\n\nsrc-791\n01:42:39.117 --> 01:42:41.453 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n去\n\n" });
